        "jsCode": "// Base64 (string dari node Extract from File) -> Buffer biner\nconst buffer = Buffer.from($json.data, 'base64');\n\n// Simpan sebagai binary n8n (dipakai jika perlu preview / download)\nconst binaryData = await this.helpers.prepareBinaryData(buffer, 'upload.jpg', 'image/jpeg');\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    sizeBytes: buffer.length,\n    // Data URL, siap dikirim ke KIE File Upload API\n    base64Data: 'data:image/jpeg;base64,' + buffer.toString('base64'),\n  },\n  binary: { data_gambar: binaryData },\n};"
      },
